Important Guidelines for Token Generation

Kripya dhyan dein ki ek mobile ek IRCTC ID aur ek network IP se 10 se zyada token generate na karein

Agar aap ek window login kar rahe hain to minimum 10 tokens hona zaruri hai. Isliye apne login aur token generation ko isi hisaab se manage karein

Agar aapke paas multiple mobiles hain to alag-alag devices se tokens generate karke send karein Token banate samay hamesha network ko off on karke process karein

Saath hi IRCTC ID ko regular interval par change karte rahein taaki process smooth bana rahe

Kripya in guidelines ko strictly follow karein for better performance

